    ['r1-t06', 'work-ceccc0', 'Points gained over 16,384 tokens', 'points (score at cap 32,768 minus score at 16,384, same run)', 'For the untrained Olmo 3 base with the cue on the 328 harder problems (one sample, T 1.0, grader v3), how many points the score at a 32,768-token cap exceeds the score of the same answers counted at 16,384 tokens.', 1.2, 'result-0c1eef', '2026-11-15T16:10:41', 'Gain +1.2 pts [0.3, 2.4]', [['run-01', 't06', 'reader-1', 5, 1, 11, 0.1574, 'About 77 base cap hits; maybe half finish in the extra tokens at a low right rate (tokens 8k-16k bought 12 problems); RL gained 2 and Think-SFT 23.'], ['run-01', 't06', 'reader-2', 6, 1, 12, -0.1869, 'About 75 cap-hit answers can continue; base long answers are right ~15 % of the time and many keep rambling, so a handful flip right.'], ['run-01', 't06', 'r6-account-rival', 2.5, 0.6, 5.5, 1.2713, "Cap hits are the hard end of the difficulty axis rather than an unfinished-but-right policy gap, so the extra 16k tokens convert only ~8 of ~70 base cap hits at its matched-difficulty solve rate: about 2.5 percentage points (between RL's +0.6 and Think-SFT's…"]]],
